  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EUBAM Libya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">According to article 2 of CD 2013/233/CFSP. This Council Decision was further amended. The current Council Decision is CD 2021/1009.&quot;EUBAM Libya shall assist the Libyan authorities in the building of state security structures in Libya, in particular in the areas of border management, law enforcement and criminal justice with a view to contributing to efforts to disrupt organised criminal networks involved notably in smuggling migrants, human trafficking and terrorism in Libya and the Central Mediterranean region.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
